# Adding or Updating Tests

When updating or creating new test files:

1. **Run ESLint** on the files to catch style issues (e.g. `jest/padding-around-expect-groups`)
2. **Run tests** to verify they pass

```bash
npx eslint path/to/touched.test.ts
npm test -- path/to/touched.test.ts
```
